  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A ball weighing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is moving with a velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the uncertainty in its velocity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, then the uncertainty in its position is _&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;(Rounded off to the nearest integer)</p><p>[Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Js</mi></math>]</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;v</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>&#916;x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;m</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>&#916;v</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
